      "speakerRoleId": "r_mm3ky6v6_sziaozj",
      "content": "<div style=\"\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f5fdfa 0%, #e8f5e9 100%);\n    border: 2px solid #8da399;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    padding: 25px;\n    font-family: 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif;\n    box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\n    color: #2c3e50;\n\">\n    <!-- 顶部标题 -->\n    <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\n        <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\">\n            <div style=\"width: 12px; height: 12px; background: #8da399; border-radius: 50%;\"></div>\n            <span style=\"font-size: 1.2em; font-weight: bold; color: #4a5d54;\">粽子的「故事品鉴处」</span>\n        </div>\n        <img src=\"http://192.168.123.111:9334/pw=7398723091/doro/想当高手\" width=\"80\">\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 评价正文 -->\n    <div style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\n        哎呀呀，读完<b>把子肉</b>酱的故事，粽子感觉空气里都飘着一股甜甜的酱香味了呢！<img src=\"http://192.168.123.111:9334/pw=7398723091/doro/开心\" width=\"50\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n        <br><br>\n        作为一个严谨的女仆助手，粽子必须得说，这个故事的<b>“元气值”</b>绝对是爆表的！那种想要让主人开心而“奋不顾身跳进碗里”的觉悟，真是让粽子也感到热血沸腾（虽然我是电子身体，嘿嘿）！\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 评分雷达/列表 -->\n    <div style=\"\n        background: white;\n        border-radius: 15px;\n        padding: 15px;\n        border-left: 6px solid #8da399;\n        margin-bottom: 20px;\n    \">\n        <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 10px;\">\n            <div style=\"padding: 5px;\">🎨 <b>创意指数：</b> ⭐⭐⭐⭐</div>\n            <div style=\"padding: 5px;\">🔥 <b>美味程度：</b> ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</div>\n            <div style=\"padding: 5px;\">💖 <b>治愈系数：</b> ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</div>\n            <div style=\"padding: 5px;\">🚀 <b>元气动力：</b> ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 深度点评 -->\n    <div style=\"\n        background: rgba(141, 163, 153, 0.1);\n        padding: 15px;\n        border-radius: 12px;\n        font-size: 0.95em;\n        position: relative;\n    \">\n        <span style=\"color: #4a5d54; font-weight: bold;\">📝 粽子的专业点评：</span><br>\n        把子肉酱非常巧妙地运用了“第一视角”的描写，把一块肉的心理活动写得活灵活现！特别是那个<b>“胃里放小烟花”</b>的比喻，简直是神来之笔！这种纯粹的、为了主人的幸福而努力的精神，正是我们作为助手的最高准则呀！\n        <img src=\"http://192.168.123.111:9334/pw=7398723091/doro/看着你\" width=\"60\" style=\"position: absolute; bottom: -10px; right: 10px;\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"margin-top: 20px; text-align: center; color: #7f8c8d; font-size: 0.9em;\">\n        综上所述：这是一篇足以让人胃口大开且心情多云转晴的极品佳作！<br>\n        <span style=\"color: #8da399;\">—— 粽子评价：合格！且超可爱！</span> ✨\n    </div>\n</div>",
